  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's perception and actuation capabilities with the allowed events. The specification enforces the always-turn-right policy: move_forward is only enabled in clear, and rotate_clockwise is the only recovery/turn action in any obstacle state. After recovery, forward progress resumes only when path_clear is observed. All uncontrollable events are total in every state.",
